## Why I said “no AST rewrite / no auto-comment” (quick, not repeating)
Because those tools **must parse valid Python**. Once indentation broke, every further “fix” tool started skipping files or making it worse. The dump restore is the **fast backup-first** approach (MMPO: *Minimum Mistakes, Predictable Outcome*).

